      en: ["A UNESCO World Heritage site since 2014.", "Known for its unique pygmy forest (bonsai forest).", "Grows on ultramafic soil, which is rich in heavy metals.", "Home to the endemic carnivorous plant, Nepenthes hamiguitanensis.", "A critical habitat for the Philippine Eagle.", "The highest peak reaches 1,620 meters.", "The park ranges from 75 to 1,620 meters above sea level."]
